              >SYMENO<span class="text-brand">.</span></a
            >
            <p class="mb-6 max-w-sm font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Operational efficiency applied to consumer electronics. We
              leverage global arbitrage to secure premium hardware at
              zero-markup wholesale rates.
            </p>

            <div class="mb-8 pt-4">
              <span
